@startuml
title One Arc height: Malachite (CL) driving Reth (EL) through the Engine API
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF6F0
  ParticipantBorderColor #2E8B67
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E8B67
}
participant "Proposer CL\n(Malachite app)" as PCL
participant "Proposer EL\n(Reth)" as PEL
participant "Other validators\nCL" as VCL
participant "Their EL\n(Reth)" as VEL
== StartedRound(h, r): proposer = (h-1+r) mod n ==
PCL -> PEL : forkchoiceUpdated(parent, attributes)
PEL --> PCL : payloadId
PCL -> PEL : getPayload(payloadId)
PEL --> PCL : ExecutionPayloadV3
PCL -> PEL : newPayload (self-check)
PCL -> VCL : stream Init | Data (128 KiB) | Fin (Ed25519 sig)
VCL -> VCL : check proposer, signature,\ntimestamp <= local + 30 s
VCL -> VEL : newPayload
VEL --> VCL : VALID / INVALID
VCL -> VCL : prevote, then precommit\n(>2/3 voting power)
PCL -> PCL : prevote, precommit
== Decided(h) ==
VCL -> VCL : store certificate + block (redb)
VCL -> VEL : forkchoiceUpdated(head = safe = finalized)
PCL -> PEL : forkchoiceUpdated(head = safe = finalized)
== Finalized(h): store evidence, extend certificate ==
VCL -> VEL : eth_call getActiveValidatorSet() at h\n+ consensusParams()
VCL -> VCL : pause to 500 ms target, start h+1
@enduml
